  "overview": {
    "text": {
      "en": "Tokyo is easier to plan as a few neighbourhood outings than a citywide checklist. Pair Asakusa with the Skytree area, and keep Meiji Jingu and Yoyogi Park together on a different day. Your airport and nearest station matter as much as the district name."
    },
