      "id": "note:place:Q1490:expansion01-cost-limits",
      "destinationId": "place:Q1490",
      "kind": "booking",
      "text": {
        "en": "No citywide rail pass is assumed to cover every operator, airport service or ticketed sight. Accommodation, meals, airport travel and chosen admissions remain costs to check, not reviewed totals."
